<h1><%= @order.event.title %></h1>

<p>
  <% if @order.event.state_cancelled? %>
    Unfortunately, this event has been cancelled. We are very sorry for any
    disappointment or inconvenience this may cause.
  <% else %>
    Your reservation for this event has been cancelled. We're sorry you could
    not attend this time, but hope to see you again in future.
  <% end %>
</p>

<ul>
  <li><%= I18n.t('views.orders.seats', count: @order.number_of_seats) %> to <%= @order.event.title %></li>
  <li><%= evtshelp_datetime(@order.event) %></li>
  <li><%= @order.event.location %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  If you have any questions about the cancellation, please get in touch:
</p>

<dl>
  <dt>E-mail us</dt>
  <dd>Just reply to this message</dd>
  <dt>Call us</dt>
  <dd><%= link_to(Hcms.config.contact_tel_human, "tel:#{Hcms.config.contact_tel_human}") %></dd>
</dl>
